            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<h3> Inside - Out hat</h3>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"ctr\" src=\"/KIN_images/garments/inside_out_hat_main.jpg\" width=\"400\"><br>Easily add fairisle to this lined hat. The lining makes an extra-warm hat and hides any floats.\r\n<br>",
